    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-1440.019",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 19,
      "x": 76,
      "y": 984,
      "width": null,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 9.5,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 16,
      "letter_spacing": 2.4,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "A NOTE ON",
        "CONTINUITY."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-55008bbb8201",
      "role": "decorative-annotation",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-1440.020",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 20,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 984,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "A useful conversation can still be difficult to return to. You remember that",
        "something became clearer, but not the exact wording, the constraint you",
        "added halfway through, or which of several windows held the decision. The",
        "conversation happened. The continuity did not arrive automatically."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-82640dae68dd",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-1440.021",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 21,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1143,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "That gap is where we place PAIA. Not in front of every conversation, asking",
        "you to prepare a perfect brief. Not above your words, deciding who you are.",
        "Beside them: a working place to find an earlier expression, see where it",
        "came from and decide whether it still belongs in the next step."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-d71c0c3a88e5",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-1440.022",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 22,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1302,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "Keeping everything is not the same as using something well. A long archive",
        "may contain questions you no longer have, quotations you never agreed",
        "with, and plans that were deliberately abandoned. Bringing all of it into a new",
        "task can obscure the very context you were trying to recover."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-cab99ed91bab",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-1440.023",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 23,
      "x1": 287,
      "y1": 1481,
      "x2": 367,
      "y2": 1481,
      "stroke": "#a0a99e",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-1440.024",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 24,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1523,
      "width": 701,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 43,
      "font_style": "italic",
      "line_height": 51,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "The useful amount may be",
        "three sentences, not three years."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-82a5cd584e11",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-1440.025",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 25,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1699,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "Selection matters. So does the ability to revise. You may want the original",
        "record to remain intact while making today’s working explanation shorter and",
        "clearer. These are compatible needs when the source and the working",
        "version do not pretend to be the same thing."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-9e2ffaaec9e4",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-1440.026",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 26,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1858,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "In this model, context is not a secret profile that a system accumulates about",
        "you. It is material you can inspect and deliberately bring to a particular",
        "question. The useful amount may be three sentences rather than three",
        "years. The relevant version may be the one you edited this morning."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-3c938990e79a",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-1440.027",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 27,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 2017,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA starts with expressions you already produce in AI conversations. Its",
        "ambition is continuity without a maintenance habit: less reconstruction, more",
        "room to continue. Capture, revisit, understand, reuse. Not a compulsory",
        "sequence, but a set of ways to make past thinking available when it",
        "becomes useful again."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-8c7dae4329fb",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-1440.028",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 28,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 2234,
      "width": 740,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 11,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 15.95,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "A product perspective, not a claim of released capability."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-02dda9d1f87c",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-en-1440.029",
